! Jay's Brochure

((Jay Kominek)) has made a ((Jay's Lojban Brochure|nice double-sided brochure)) available.

! CafePress Stores

A couple of lojbanists have made CafePress stores.  Note that, as
far as I know, none of the revenues from these stores go to the LLG.

* [http://www.cafeshops.com/cp/store.aspx?s=logfest|The LogFest Store] by [http://wiki.lojban.org/index.php?Mark%20Shoulson|Mark Shoulson].
* [http://www.cafeshops.com/cp/store.aspx?s=lojban|The Lojban Store] by [http://wiki.lojban.org/index.php?Jay%20Kominek|Jay Kominek]
